## PROJECT_SETUP

This document explain which the azure resources used in the Shopesense project were created and configured.


## 1. Azure Resource Group

  A dedicated Azure resource group was created to keep all shopesense resources together.
  It provides a single location for managing, monitoring and deleting project resources.  


  


  

## 2. ADLS Gen2 — Initial Source File Storage

The original CSV source files were first uploaded to Azure Data Lake Storage Gen2.  
Azure Data Factory pipelines were then used to load these files into Azure SQL Database, which was treated as the primary source system for the main data pipeline.




  
